<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11247" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαΐσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαιολ-ᾴσσω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spring from</i> a height, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρημνοῦ ἀπαΐξας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.234
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>dart away,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπόταν μὲν ἀπαΐξῃ τέρεν αἷμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					100.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. ib.<i><span class="en">
				23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ δ᾽ ἐγὼ κλύων ἀπῇξα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					190
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				468
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπῇξε πέμφιξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					337
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρένες . . γνώμης ἀπῇξαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					448
				</span></i>
			. [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπᾱ-</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hom.
				</span></i>
			, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀΐσσω.]</span></div>
